  username: Grim Lynn
  photo: {fileID: 5838281212545866351, guid: 8a4496cf0089a39478705db3ecaa50fe, type: 3}
  deadPhoto: {fileID: 0}
  description: It's grim lynn time
  greetings:
  - Hi! Nice meeting you. I really like that shiny watch in your picture.
  positive:
  - You really get me! I agree.
  - I think that's worth my time. My money? Not sure yet.
  - Your mind really can be as bright as a diamond!
  - (snorting laugh)
  - I think I'll invest in you.
  negative:
  - That was a really cheap line. Even cheaper than your outfit.
  - You seriously thought that would work?
  - Tick-tock. Your time is running out!
  - I don't have all day for your nonsense!
  - (cringes) Cheesy. I don't like cheese.
  death:
  - That was... really not worth it...
  conversationSuccess:
  - Money is the thing I love the most in the world, but you might be number two.
    Or three, actually, after gold.
  conversationFail:
  - Ew! Don't waste my time. Or money.
  apartmentDialogues:
  - It's kinda small in here... I was expecting a nicer place.
  - So, what do you do for a living? Something that earns a lot of money?
  - For, uh... research purposes, if you had a ton of money, where would you hide
    it?
  conversationRules:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7f5c8b9f77d6d1343946eb2e26c05fe9, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: e04d19f1afbc7d0438e9136f4802dc5f, type: 2}
